    (property "Note" "START-UP feed only since BOOST-SLOPE: the follower off the output takes VDD once the boost runs. 180, down from 220, so VDD is 4.77 V at the cranking dip through the Schottky. Pulse 2a: 143 mA, 47.5 V on VDD_BAT, 3.7 W for 50 us." (id 5) (at 80.0 556.0 0)
