    (property "Chosen" "Vishay FRED Pt, 200 V, 16 A avg, 250 A surge, trr 32 ns, AEC-Q101. SMPD (TO-263AC), cathode on the tab -- no KiCad 7 footprint, drawn in phase 3" (id 6) (at 390.0 119.0 0)
